<title>USA: ACCOUNT CLOSED -- Michigan Building Authority.</title>
<headline>ACCOUNT CLOSED -- Michigan Building Authority.</headline>
<text>
<p>STATE BUILDING AUTHORITY</p>
<p>STATE OF MICHIGAN</p>
<p>RE: $42,865,000</p>
<p>1997 REVENUE BONDS, SERIES B</p>
<p>(EQUIPMENT PROGRAM)</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
